        "name": "Variables",
        "info": "Headset data\n(i) Worn\n- Is the device being taken on or off? (0: Not taken off/on; 1: Taken off/on)\n\n(ii) Bat\n- Headset battery level (/100)\n\n(iii) Mic\n- Mic Peak-to-peak value\n\nGloves data (R - Right; L - Left)\n(i) L Bat\n- Left battery level (/100)\n\n(ii) R Bat\n- Right battery level (/100)\n\n(iii) BPM\n- Average BPM of both L and R fingers\n\n(iv) A\n- BPM Alerts, if BPM reaches > 120 or < 60 for 10 consecutive readings \n(0: No alert; 1: Alert danger)\n\n\n",
